	(text "PS/2 KEYBOARD CONTROLLER (VIDEO-G TEXT'S, FIRMWARE embedded/video-g-ps2)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 12.7 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "3cf397a0-1c29-5df2-9295-57e43710f67f"))
	(text "The ATmega328P reads the PS/2 keyboard on J3 (clock and data pulled up by R8, R9; +5 V through F1) and puts each key's\ncode on MD0-MD7. IC22 holds it in reset while the bus -RESET is low (MRST); R7 pulls its reset up, and C24 lets\nthe FTDI cable on J4 reset it to load firmware. Y1: 16 MHz." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 17.78 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "c67b9ee9-cd57-5b9a-841f-2c9824774335"))
	(embedded_fonts no)
)
